(27209,3,0,'OW...NO! We know that you\'ve been stealing our armor and weapons and horses!',15,0,0,0,0,0,'EventAI text -804'),
(27209,4,0,'We know... that you don\'t... know why we\'re immune... to your so-called blight. Grand Admiral Westwind somehow gave the high abbot that prayer. I beg you... no more... please?',15,0,0,0,0,0,'EventAI text -805'),
(27209,5,0,'AHHHHHHHHH! Please... we know... that you... have a spy... disguised as... one of us! There... that\'s all that I know. Please... mercy... STOP!',15,0,0,0,0,0,'EventAI text -806'),
